{"strongs": "H3759", "word": "כַּרְמֶל", "translit": "kar.mel", "root": "כרמל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "plantation, garden-land", "definition": "I. כַּרְמֶל noun masculine Isa 29:17 1. plantation, garden-land . 2. fruit, garden-growth ( ל + כֶּרֶם , compare Ges «GKC:85»§ 85 , 52 Sta § 299 ); — absolute ׳ כ Isa 16:10 + 12 t.; suffix כַּדְמִלּוֺ Isa 10:18 + 2 t.; — 1. garden-land , Isa 16:10 ׅ || ( כְּרָמִים , Isa 10:18 ׅ || (יַעַר , Isa 29:17 (twice in verse) (opposed to לְבָנוֺן יַעַר ), Isa 32:15 (twice in verse) (opposed to מִדְבָּר יַעַר ), v Isa 32:16 ; Jer 4:26 (opposed to מִדְבָּר ), Jer 48:33 ; 2Chr 26:10 (opposed to הֶהָרִים ); ׳ אֶרֶץ הַכּ Jer 2:7 the country of garden-land , i.e. fertile; יַעַָר כַּרְמִלּוֺ 2Kgs 19:23 = Isa 37:24 , the garden-like forest of it (namely of Lebanon). On Mic 7:14 see II. כַּרְמֶל . 2. by metonymy ( fresh ) fruit, garden growth , 2Kgs 4:42 (+ לֶחֶם שְׂעוֺרִים Lev 2:14 (+ קָוָּי בָּאֵשׁאָבִיב and גֶּרֶשׂ , q. v.); ׳ לֶחֶם וְקָלִי וכ Lev 23:14 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4200')\">BDB4200</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3759')\">H3759</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4199')\">BDB4199</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4201')\">BDB4201</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>כַּרְמֶל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 29:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,17)\">Isa 29:17</ref></sup> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlightword>plantation, garden-land</highlightword>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlightword>fruit, garden-growth</highlightword> (<bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>כֶּרֶם</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:85»§ 85</sup>, 52 <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>§ 299</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 16:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10